  = note: an attribute that is present is evaluated even when empty; an empty expression raises `error.execution` instead of behaving as if the attribute were absent
  = help: write the condition this `<if>` branch tests; `cond` is required on `<if>`, so a last branch that always runs is written as `<else/>`
